{"4189120":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Debauchery & Magic","steam_appid":4189120,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap<\/h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Phase 1 — Core Development (Ongoing)<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building and refining the core gameplay systems<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Implementing professions, abilities, and combat mechanics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worldbuilding: zones, dungeons, monsters, traversal, and mounts<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Networking foundations for seamless online co-op<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polishing UI\/UX, inventory systems, abilities, and player progression<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Phase 2 — Closed Playtesting (Current)<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite-only playtests to gather feedback on stability and gameplay balance<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stress testing online multiplayer and server performance<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iterating on combat flow, ability balance, and dungeon generation<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanding content based on tester feedback (weapons, abilities, enemies, biomes)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Phase 3 — Early Access Launch<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to establish a foundation for Early Access with:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay loop<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated dungeons, professions, abilities, and loot systems<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An initial online co-op experience<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following launch, we plan to focus on bug fixes, performance tuning, and quality-of-life improvements, while using community feedback to help shape future updates.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Phase 4 — Early Access Updates<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access, we hope to build on our Phase 3 foundation with:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New zones, dungeons, and world events<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional professions and advanced ability paths<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded crafting, alchemy, and economy systems<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New bosses, mini-bosses, and elite monster variants<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeper multiplayer features and social systems<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Further optimization across supported platforms<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our priorities may evolve based on player feedback, technical feasibility, and development progress.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Phase 5 — Toward Full Release<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As we work toward version 1.0, our goals include:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bringing the main storyline and core progression systems to their intended scope<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refining co-op and endgame gameplay<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanding late-game content, potentially including additional dungeons and raids<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Further balancing weapons, abilities, professions, and enemies<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adding achievements, controller support, and accessibility options<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scope and timing of full release will depend on how the game develops throughout Early Access.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beyond 1.0 — Ideas We’d Like to Explore<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on development capacity and player interest, we’d love to explore:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New biomes and larger content expansions<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal events and rotating dungeon modifiers<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional professions, mounts, and advanced gameplay systems<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Further multiplayer and co-op enhancements<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/d87cb809564b19aa8b413289b9f1fd50.avif?t=1792383083\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras_big\/d87cb809564b19aa8b413289b9f1fd50.webp?t=1792383083 width=1560 height=760 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Debauchery &amp; Magic<\/strong>, you find yourself in the world of Haven: A fantastical place filled to the brim of your wizard hat with never-ending celebrations and a bustling economy fueled by indulgence. As expected, the newly crowned Prince Baytre’s coronation was a party for the ages!  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or it was...until you woke up the next morning. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Debauchery has been outlawed. Revelry is banned. Shenanigans of all sorts are no longer tolerated by the royal family, by penalty of death.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is, unless you step up. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/8b35150c82cb905bc35b7068bbf2db68.poster.avif?t=1792383083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/8b35150c82cb905bc35b7068bbf2db68.webm?t=1792383083\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/8b35150c82cb905bc35b7068bbf2db68.mp4?t=1792383083\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/4601f08e4cc47b78926ec8a1836a35a2.avif?t=1792383083\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras_big\/4601f08e4cc47b78926ec8a1836a35a2.webp?t=1792383083 width=1560 height=245 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo, or with up to 11 friends, take the fight to Haven’s shadow government and leave a blazing trail of indulgence in your wake. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest, loot, and fight the powers that be with a variety of magic and weaponry. Drink concoctions that empower your spells but ruin your coordination. Smoke alchemical blends that'll send you into next week. Gamble your life savings in gold against the house, or your friends, in a myriad of games hidden away in secretive casinos. Or just laze the day away fishing for exotic and uncouth aquatic creatures. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you can even stunt on the townsfolk with your gnarly skateboard skills across the fantasy world of Haven. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/d1030bff4108fbf6a7b8e3a8c4aa9bbf.poster.avif?t=1792383083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/d1030bff4108fbf6a7b8e3a8c4aa9bbf.webm?t=1792383083\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/d1030bff4108fbf6a7b8e3a8c4aa9bbf.mp4?t=1792383083\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a dark-fantasy world where spellcasting, danger, and indulgence collide. Explore cursed kingdoms, tavern hideouts, underground gambling halls, and halls of arcane corruption as you shape your destiny through equal parts <strong>mystical energy and reckless decision-making<\/strong>. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The royal family won’t know what hit them, until a fireball is headed their way. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/fd15f0ef123c76bcb532a9288669e307.avif?t=1792383083\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras_big\/fd15f0ef123c76bcb532a9288669e307.webp?t=1792383083 width=1560 height=245 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’ll take more than moxie and harsh words to free the people of Haven from their newfound tyranny – and that’s where your professions will shine. Sharpen your skills in a variety of professions to further embody the life debaucherous...the people need your guidance, after all.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brewing <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carpentry <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gambling <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Herbalism <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smithing <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woodcutting <\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/84cf4f657ceda4abe8ee1af0913f007a.avif?t=1792383083\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras_big\/84cf4f657ceda4abe8ee1af0913f007a.webp?t=1792383083 width=1560 height=245 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as<\/strong> <strong>a<\/strong> <strong>Debaucherously Powerful Wizard<\/strong><br>Be it as a close-range brawler or long range spellcaster, you choose how to take the fight to the tainted royals and defend the people of Haven. Live your ultimate wizard fantasy as a boundless hero...or  an epic quest to restore debauchery to the land of Haven. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Drinking &amp; Drug Systems<\/strong>  <br>Your magic is powerful—but so are your vices. Drinking, smoking, and all manners of indulgence directly influence your stats, abilities, and combat flow. Buffs, debuffs, hallucinations, and chaotic side effects…it’s all part of the lifestyle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/9b6d90f2b4ada6567fa113da3d96f98b.poster.avif?t=1792383083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/9b6d90f2b4ada6567fa113da3d96f98b.webm?t=1792383083\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/9b6d90f2b4ada6567fa113da3d96f98b.mp4?t=1792383083\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Dungeons &amp; Weapons<\/strong>  <br>Every dungeon run features new layouts, traps, loot, and spell modifiers. Weapons roll unique stats and magical properties, letting you build absurdly powerful or hilariously unstable loadouts. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Co-Op<\/strong>  <br>Experience debauchery with friends. Drink together, gamble together, dive into dungeons together, and resurrect each other after terrible decisions. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only the Gnarliest Mode of Transportation<\/strong> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizards shredding on skateboards? Radical! <\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/d87cb809564b19aa8b413289b9f1fd50.avif?t=1792383083\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras_big\/d87cb809564b19aa8b413289b9f1fd50.webp?t=1792383083 width=1560 height=760 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Debauchery &amp; Magic<\/strong>, you find yourself in the world of Haven: A fantastical place filled to the brim of your wizard hat with never-ending celebrations and a bustling economy fueled by indulgence. As expected, the newly crowned Prince Baytre’s coronation was a party for the ages!  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or it was...until you woke up the next morning. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Debauchery has been outlawed. Revelry is banned. Shenanigans of all sorts are no longer tolerated by the royal family, by penalty of death.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is, unless you step up. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/8b35150c82cb905bc35b7068bbf2db68.poster.avif?t=1792383083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/8b35150c82cb905bc35b7068bbf2db68.webm?t=1792383083\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/8b35150c82cb905bc35b7068bbf2db68.mp4?t=1792383083\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/4601f08e4cc47b78926ec8a1836a35a2.avif?t=1792383083\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras_big\/4601f08e4cc47b78926ec8a1836a35a2.webp?t=1792383083 width=1560 height=245 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo, or with up to 11 friends, take the fight to Haven’s shadow government and leave a blazing trail of indulgence in your wake. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest, loot, and fight the powers that be with a variety of magic and weaponry. Drink concoctions that empower your spells but ruin your coordination. Smoke alchemical blends that'll send you into next week. Gamble your life savings in gold against the house, or your friends, in a myriad of games hidden away in secretive casinos. Or just laze the day away fishing for exotic and uncouth aquatic creatures. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you can even stunt on the townsfolk with your gnarly skateboard skills across the fantasy world of Haven. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/d1030bff4108fbf6a7b8e3a8c4aa9bbf.poster.avif?t=1792383083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/d1030bff4108fbf6a7b8e3a8c4aa9bbf.webm?t=1792383083\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/d1030bff4108fbf6a7b8e3a8c4aa9bbf.mp4?t=1792383083\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a dark-fantasy world where spellcasting, danger, and indulgence collide. Explore cursed kingdoms, tavern hideouts, underground gambling halls, and halls of arcane corruption as you shape your destiny through equal parts <strong>mystical energy and reckless decision-making<\/strong>. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The royal family won’t know what hit them, until a fireball is headed their way. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/fd15f0ef123c76bcb532a9288669e307.avif?t=1792383083\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras_big\/fd15f0ef123c76bcb532a9288669e307.webp?t=1792383083 width=1560 height=245 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’ll take more than moxie and harsh words to free the people of Haven from their newfound tyranny – and that’s where your professions will shine. Sharpen your skills in a variety of professions to further embody the life debaucherous...the people need your guidance, after all.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brewing <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carpentry <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gambling <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Herbalism <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smithing <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woodcutting <\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/84cf4f657ceda4abe8ee1af0913f007a.avif?t=1792383083\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras_big\/84cf4f657ceda4abe8ee1af0913f007a.webp?t=1792383083 width=1560 height=245 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as<\/strong> <strong>a<\/strong> <strong>Debaucherously Powerful Wizard<\/strong><br>Be it as a close-range brawler or long range spellcaster, you choose how to take the fight to the tainted royals and defend the people of Haven. Live your ultimate wizard fantasy as a boundless hero...or  an epic quest to restore debauchery to the land of Haven. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Drinking &amp; Drug Systems<\/strong>  <br>Your magic is powerful—but so are your vices. Drinking, smoking, and all manners of indulgence directly influence your stats, abilities, and combat flow. Buffs, debuffs, hallucinations, and chaotic side effects…it’s all part of the lifestyle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/9b6d90f2b4ada6567fa113da3d96f98b.poster.avif?t=1792383083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/9b6d90f2b4ada6567fa113da3d96f98b.webm?t=1792383083\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/extras\/9b6d90f2b4ada6567fa113da3d96f98b.mp4?t=1792383083\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Dungeons &amp; Weapons<\/strong>  <br>Every dungeon run features new layouts, traps, loot, and spell modifiers. Weapons roll unique stats and magical properties, letting you build absurdly powerful or hilariously unstable loadouts. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Co-Op<\/strong>  <br>Experience debauchery with friends. Drink together, gamble together, dive into dungeons together, and resurrect each other after terrible decisions. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only the Gnarliest Mode of Transportation<\/strong> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizards shredding on skateboards? Radical! <\/p>","short_description":"In Haven, magic thrives and debauchery is strictly forbidden. Defy a ruthless new ruler as you and your friends quest, loot, party, and battle your way across the kingdom to bring freedom back to its people.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/aabe452df1c4e4acf37ce61e6b69bba5196627d0\/header.jpg?t=1792383083","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/c6cb0a1d455e09568e1aac5c0536c3e1c3813d61\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792383083","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4189120\/c6cb0a1d455e09568e1aac5c0536c3e1c3813d61\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792383083","website":"https:\/\/3rdshiftstudios.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Yes<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Optional<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 69 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Probably<br><\/li><li><strong>VR Support:<\/strong> Na<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"Copyright \/ Trademark Notice<br \/>\r\n© 2025 3rd Shift Studios. All rights reserved.<br \/>\r\nDebauchery & Magic™, D&M™, and all associated logos, characters, and content are trademarks of 3rd Shift Studios."}}}